{
  "info": {
    "name": "Absensi WFH - End-to-End API",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
    "description": "Run on a development database after migration/seed and while both NestJS processes are running. Read postman/README.md first. The runner creates a unique test employee, performs check-in and photo replacement, verifies HRD read-only access, deletes the test attendance, and deactivates the test employee. It leaves an inactive employee record because the API intentionally has no employee DELETE endpoint. Choose the bundled PNG files for both multipart requests. Do not export a collection after entering passwords, tokens, or private keys."
  },
